---
import {mount} from "../documents/context";
const root=mount(Astro.request);
import Layout from "../components/DocumentLayout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Wiki settings" active="settings" description="Documents, history, and connected information.">
 <nav aria-label="Document tools"><a href={`${root}documents`}>All documents</a> · <a href={`${root}new`}>Create document</a></nav>
 <p>Graph types, relationships, and graph changes are managed in Onto.</p>
 <p>Document edits are saved as drafts. Publishing preserves earlier revisions.</p>
 <p>Pages may link to Onto entities. Source access is checked whenever linked information is read.</p>
 <p>Generated updates remain drafts unless automatic publication is enabled for the page. Required approvals still apply.</p>
</Layout>
